WEBVTT

00:24.170 --> 00:25.340
You've been spending

00:25.340 --> 00:27.200
less and less time with us lately.

00:27.510 --> 00:29.510
Can't you even spare time for a meal?

00:29.830 --> 00:31.540
We finally managed to catch you today,

00:31.540 --> 00:33.750
and you're leaving again
right after sitting down.

00:33.750 --> 00:35.280
Are we still buddies or not?

00:40.000 --> 00:41.600
Wait, this watch of yours...

00:42.090 --> 00:43.560
Did you dig this out of
your great-grandfather's

00:43.560 --> 00:45.020
collection or something?

00:45.030 --> 00:47.360
This is an antique, a limited edition.

00:47.640 --> 00:48.710
It could go straight into
a horology museum

00:48.710 --> 00:50.140
as an exhibit.

00:50.520 --> 00:52.250
It's so rare and high-end.

00:52.270 --> 00:54.600
There are barely any in the whole country.

01:15.280 --> 01:16.080
Records room—

01:16.560 --> 01:17.800
pull up every case

01:17.840 --> 01:18.710
Chief Lu was involved in

01:18.710 --> 01:19.840
during the year before he passed away.

01:19.840 --> 01:20.310
Now.

02:45.530 --> 02:49.290
[Born with Luck]

02:49.410 --> 02:52.350
[Episode 9]

02:52.450 --> 02:57.660
[Fenglinwan]

03:02.710 --> 03:03.430
Yibo.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.710
How could you tell the police

03:05.710 --> 03:06.520
the truth?

03:06.680 --> 03:08.540
Mr. Rong told me to say it that way.

03:13.400 --> 03:14.260
Then I guess...

03:15.240 --> 03:17.150
this matter's basically over.

03:23.000 --> 03:23.750
But Zhou Rong

03:24.710 --> 03:25.960
won't trust you the way

03:25.960 --> 03:26.870
he used to.

03:29.190 --> 03:29.920
Don't worry.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.760
I have a backup plan.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.360
The night of Ye Jian's incident,

03:34.360 --> 03:36.079
he came to Fenglinwan to see me.

03:36.079 --> 03:36.800
What for?

03:38.840 --> 03:39.590
He asked me

03:39.630 --> 03:40.680
where I got this watch.

03:40.680 --> 03:41.410
I'm guessing

03:41.710 --> 03:42.910
it might be evidence.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.360
Evidence of what?

03:46.680 --> 03:49.079
Most likely connected to Lu Zheng's death.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.030
Here!

04:01.840 --> 04:03.040
Let's have a sausage.

04:04.030 --> 04:04.960
Here, come here.

04:06.030 --> 04:06.470
Chao,

04:07.400 --> 04:08.590
I want a sausage too.

04:10.310 --> 04:11.570
I'll get you one later.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.120
Let's go. Go.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.600
Chao,

04:26.870 --> 04:27.730
the car is here.

05:06.420 --> 05:08.730
♪ The sun is setting ♪

05:09.750 --> 05:10.390
Chao.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.010
Can we keep up with them?

05:14.890 --> 05:16.510
Why is the math book sad?

05:16.530 --> 05:18.390
Because it has too many problems.

05:24.160 --> 05:24.800
Mr. Rong,

05:25.600 --> 05:26.480
the doctor said

05:26.720 --> 05:28.850
laughing more is good for your health.

05:37.310 --> 05:38.840
That car can still run, huh?

05:40.750 --> 05:41.980
Drive more steadily.

05:42.000 --> 05:44.860
Stop looking around
and getting distracted, okay?

05:47.860 --> 05:49.490
Never mind a Mercedes—

05:50.630 --> 05:51.830
even a Ferrari couldn't

05:51.830 --> 05:52.960
slip out of my grasp.

05:59.510 --> 06:00.040
Mr. Rong,

06:00.480 --> 06:02.240
you're just too soft-hearted.

06:02.560 --> 06:03.620
That's why your men

06:03.630 --> 06:05.050
start getting ideas.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.740
I told you to drive steady—

06:07.800 --> 06:09.460
not crawl like an ox cart, huh?

06:22.340 --> 06:23.400
We lost them, Chao.

06:24.030 --> 06:26.560
Like the Foolish Old Man
moved the mountains.

06:26.560 --> 06:28.020
We tailed him for about...

06:29.680 --> 06:31.210
2,000 meters today, right?

06:31.430 --> 06:32.360
Tomorrow we start again

06:32.360 --> 06:33.350
from here.

06:33.390 --> 06:35.070
If we lose him tomorrow again,
we'll pick it up the day after.

06:35.070 --> 06:36.950
And again the day after that.

06:37.870 --> 06:38.690
Don't worry.

06:39.070 --> 06:40.120
A big boss like him

06:40.190 --> 06:41.990
won't live far from his company.

06:42.920 --> 06:43.750
Give it a few days,

06:43.750 --> 06:45.409
and we'll find where he lives.

06:46.600 --> 06:49.659
A journey of a thousand miles
begins with a single step.

07:10.000 --> 07:10.560
Chao,

07:11.310 --> 07:12.360
we clipped someone!

07:12.360 --> 07:13.000
So?

07:13.120 --> 07:14.780
Pull over and call the police?

07:16.480 --> 07:17.160
I don't have

07:17.190 --> 07:18.650
110 in my contacts anyway.

07:46.390 --> 07:46.920
Fang?

07:47.430 --> 07:47.950
Are you alright?

07:47.950 --> 07:48.680
Chief Huang.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.159
-Be careful.
-Sit, sit.

07:51.180 --> 07:52.510
-Sit down.
-Fang. Fang.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.700
Fang.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.240
Sit down. Sit.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.600
It's nothing, just a minor injury.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.070
What exactly happened?

08:02.560 --> 08:03.290
Chief Huang,

08:04.480 --> 08:06.140
I've been wanting to make sure

08:06.870 --> 08:08.430
the East New Town project
is finished properly

08:08.430 --> 08:09.560
before my transfer.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.190
I can't leave any trouble

08:11.190 --> 08:13.040
for the colleagues taking over.

08:15.940 --> 08:18.000
There's just so much to sort through.

08:18.120 --> 08:18.850
Chief Huang,

08:19.190 --> 08:21.190
I've been losing sleep for days,

08:21.240 --> 08:22.970
tossing and turning all night.

08:23.680 --> 08:25.480
I really couldn't hold on today.

08:25.950 --> 08:27.650
I fell on my way home.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.390
Well...

08:30.680 --> 08:32.010
I've made you all worry.

08:32.080 --> 08:33.270
Sorry to trouble you all.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.220
You've been

08:34.360 --> 08:35.909
overworking yourself!

08:37.669 --> 08:38.549
And there were some things

08:38.549 --> 08:40.150
I should've handled sooner.

08:40.360 --> 08:40.870
Doctor,

08:41.240 --> 08:41.960
is it serious?

08:41.960 --> 08:43.289
He's fine. Don't worry.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.170
Take care of him.

08:45.510 --> 08:46.970
Chief Huang, you go ahead.

08:47.670 --> 08:49.070
Everything else is okay?

08:49.870 --> 08:51.030
Still a bit dizzy.

08:51.840 --> 08:52.360
Dizzy?

08:52.390 --> 08:53.120
I feel dizzy.

08:55.650 --> 08:56.500
You guys

08:56.600 --> 08:57.510
wait for me at the door.

08:57.510 --> 08:58.670
I need to have a word with Fang.

08:58.670 --> 09:00.320
Director Fang, rest up and recover.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.150
We'll head back first.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.000
We're heading out.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.200
Thank you for coming.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.240
Chief Huang.

09:05.240 --> 09:06.970
I've got some good news for you.

09:07.670 --> 09:09.240
Just now, I reported your situation

09:09.240 --> 09:10.970
to the municipal authorities.

09:11.120 --> 09:12.460
They also agree

09:12.510 --> 09:13.270
that you shouldn't keep

09:13.270 --> 09:14.800
working this hard anymore.

09:15.440 --> 09:16.840
As for the East New Town project,

09:16.840 --> 09:19.640
just hand it over
to the newly arrived colleagues.

09:21.960 --> 09:22.690
Chief Huang.

09:25.030 --> 09:26.040
I don't even know

09:26.240 --> 09:27.480
how to thank you now.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.210
It's nothing. Calm down.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.120
Okay.

09:33.630 --> 09:34.150
Okay.

09:37.440 --> 09:37.910
Okay.

10:06.720 --> 10:07.270
Kai.

10:08.000 --> 10:08.550
Kai!

10:09.030 --> 10:10.600
What a coincidence running into you.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.120
Ran into you on my way out...

10:12.120 --> 10:12.840
Wait, Kai.

10:12.870 --> 10:13.960
-I need to talk to you about something.
-What?

10:13.960 --> 10:15.320
Since it's the holidays,

10:15.320 --> 10:16.960
I want you to take your sister

10:16.980 --> 10:17.580
and Xin

10:17.610 --> 10:18.890
on a trip to Sanya.

10:19.030 --> 10:20.030
What do you think?

10:22.740 --> 10:25.070
[Lin Kai,
Fang Yong's Former Brother-in-law]

10:24.840 --> 10:25.270
Well,

10:25.510 --> 10:26.630
you...

10:26.670 --> 10:27.320
Let go!

10:37.720 --> 10:38.650
What's going on?

10:39.170 --> 10:40.480
Trying to get back together
with my sister?

10:40.480 --> 10:41.740
She already has a boyfriend now.

10:41.740 --> 10:43.250
No, no.

10:44.910 --> 10:46.440
I need to ask you for a favor.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.120
You?

10:47.510 --> 10:48.710
Have a favor to ask me?

10:49.360 --> 10:50.000
That sounds

10:50.000 --> 10:51.080
so weird.

10:51.120 --> 10:51.770
It's true.

10:51.800 --> 10:52.690
It's true.

10:54.260 --> 10:55.530
You're the only expert in this field

10:55.530 --> 10:56.570
that I know.

11:00.910 --> 11:02.040
Go ahead, what is it?

11:04.140 --> 11:05.270
Here's the thing...

11:06.120 --> 11:06.600
Kai.

11:09.990 --> 11:11.590
I want you to beat me up.

11:12.490 --> 11:13.760
Not too badly,

11:13.820 --> 11:15.420
because I still have to work.

11:15.630 --> 11:17.160
But not too lightly either—

11:17.360 --> 11:18.640
it has to leave marks.

11:19.680 --> 11:21.740
You're the expert at this.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.630
Based on my requirements,

11:24.150 --> 11:24.810
what kind of injuries

11:24.810 --> 11:26.340
do you think

11:26.370 --> 11:27.900
would be most appropriate?

11:35.720 --> 11:37.520
Are you crazy?

11:37.910 --> 11:38.870
No, no, Kai!

11:39.750 --> 11:40.410
Listen...

11:40.550 --> 11:42.090
K-Kai, listen.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.270
I really need you

11:43.270 --> 11:44.120
to beat me up.

11:44.550 --> 11:45.780
Name your price.

11:45.810 --> 11:46.470
Just say it.

11:47.030 --> 11:48.890
If you keep bothering me, I'll...

11:49.670 --> 11:50.360
Now?

11:54.270 --> 11:54.870
Come on.

11:55.510 --> 11:56.030
Come on.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.000
I-I'm telling you,

11:58.000 --> 11:58.600
if you keep following me,

11:58.600 --> 12:00.060
I'll really kick your ass!

12:05.670 --> 12:06.740
You nut.

12:08.080 --> 12:08.630
Kai.

12:09.390 --> 12:10.320
Listen to me.

12:10.880 --> 12:12.480
Just help me this once, okay?

12:29.080 --> 12:30.200
Got new belts

12:30.720 --> 12:31.750
and a new battery.

12:32.630 --> 12:34.030
Oil and filter changed.

12:35.910 --> 12:36.550
I even topped it up

12:36.550 --> 12:38.480
with two bottles of fuel additive.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.600
No way he gets away today.

12:46.120 --> 12:46.910
Watch closely.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.110
I'm gonna take a leak.

13:03.110 --> 13:04.670
Chao, hurry!

13:04.720 --> 13:06.360
He's out. Hurry! Hurry up!

13:20.380 --> 13:21.520
Which way did he go?

13:25.510 --> 13:28.040
I turned around to call you,
so I didn't see it.

13:30.750 --> 13:32.810
How are we supposed to chase him then?

13:34.920 --> 13:36.380
What are you even good for?

13:36.870 --> 13:37.270
Well,

13:37.270 --> 13:38.720
you were the one who had to pee this time.

13:38.720 --> 13:39.780
You can't blame me.

13:43.870 --> 13:44.470
It's fine.

13:45.150 --> 13:46.210
I have another way.

13:50.200 --> 13:52.110
[Lu Zheng car accident]
[Ye Jian's murdered]

14:05.900 --> 14:07.110
[Lu Zheng] [The one who hired the killer]
[Motive]

14:07.110 --> 14:08.250
[Shen Gang, hit-and-run driver]
[The car with high beams on]

14:08.250 --> 14:12.940
[Ye Jian murdered]

14:10.760 --> 14:11.900
♪ Hard ♪

14:12.960 --> 14:15.380
[The stone engraved with "Yi'ang"]

14:14.010 --> 14:16.850
♪ Oh, it's so hard ♪

14:19.770 --> 14:21.920
♪ Just trying to get by ♪

14:25.700 --> 14:27.910
♪ But life never cuts you a break ♪

14:38.720 --> 14:40.480
Where is

14:40.510 --> 14:41.630
the breakthrough?

14:59.720 --> 15:01.870
We need to check the files
on the provincial capital explosion case.

15:01.870 --> 15:03.480
Check the files
on the provincial capital explosion case.

15:03.480 --> 15:04.210
Chief Zhang.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.400
Wang.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.030
Good evening, officers.

15:09.170 --> 15:11.770
[Precious Metal Appraisal Certificate]

15:13.490 --> 15:15.220
Chief Zhang even noticed that?

15:19.870 --> 15:20.600
Chief Zhang,

15:20.750 --> 15:22.280
I understand what you mean.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.080
Then you go ahead

15:24.080 --> 15:25.610
and explain it to everyone.

15:26.790 --> 15:28.080
The provincial capital explosion case

15:28.080 --> 15:29.130
seems unrelated,

15:29.320 --> 15:30.390
but you've long found

15:30.390 --> 15:32.450
the connection between them, right?

15:35.150 --> 15:35.680
Alright.

15:35.870 --> 15:36.630
Go on then.

15:36.870 --> 15:39.270
The pieces of gold jewelry stolen
in the explosion case

15:39.270 --> 15:40.840
[Precious Metal Appraisal Certificate]

15:39.630 --> 15:41.290
ended up being worn by Zhou Qi.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.670
Isn't this our breakthrough?

15:55.460 --> 15:56.580
[Toll Gate]

16:06.840 --> 16:07.320
Chao,

16:08.240 --> 16:11.000
we're not tailing that bastard anymore—
we're waiting for him here?

16:11.000 --> 16:11.720
How did the Foolish Old Man

16:11.720 --> 16:13.250
finally move the mountain?

16:15.510 --> 16:16.720
Did he dig it away,

16:16.750 --> 16:17.910
shovel by shovel?

16:18.320 --> 16:19.150
No.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.460
The gods helped him move it.

16:22.480 --> 16:24.200
Not gods, but as good as gods!

16:26.910 --> 16:27.640
I reread

16:27.670 --> 16:29.150
the story of the Foolish Old Man

16:29.150 --> 16:31.550
and realized
we've been using a dumb method.

16:31.550 --> 16:33.050
A big boss like Zhou Rong

16:33.080 --> 16:34.740
must live in a luxury mansion.

16:35.390 --> 16:37.150
He took this road in the morning,

16:37.150 --> 16:37.600
right?

16:38.030 --> 16:39.320
On this road,
the only upscale neighborhoods

16:39.320 --> 16:40.550
are Zijin Garden on the left

16:40.550 --> 16:42.440
and Chenqiao Residence on the right.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.300
We don't need to tail him anymore.

16:44.870 --> 16:45.840
We just need to

16:45.870 --> 16:46.600
wait here

16:47.080 --> 16:48.680
and watch which way he turns.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.690
Then we'll know where he lives.

16:53.020 --> 16:54.760
[Toll Gate]

16:53.720 --> 16:55.380
What if he gets on the highway?

16:57.480 --> 16:58.960
You think a big boss like him

16:58.960 --> 17:00.960
would live in some suburban rental,

17:01.510 --> 17:02.630
cramming on a packed bus for over an hour

17:02.630 --> 17:04.230
every day just to get to work?

17:12.550 --> 17:13.480
Chao, he's here.

17:15.829 --> 17:16.829
Let's see if he turns on the left

17:16.829 --> 17:17.960
or right turn signal.

17:17.960 --> 17:18.640
He's signaling.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.569
He's signaling.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.330
He took the highway.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.000
I've thought it through for you.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.790
You should take the bronze bianzhong set,

17:40.790 --> 17:41.990
not that lousy plate.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.400
Why?

17:45.110 --> 17:46.160
The bianzhong set,

17:46.160 --> 17:48.280
43.8 million.

17:48.550 --> 17:50.660
That lousy plate is only 20 million.

17:50.790 --> 17:51.880
That's a difference of

17:51.880 --> 17:53.490
23.8 million.

17:53.750 --> 17:54.790
Besides,

17:55.160 --> 17:56.920
a set of bianzhong has real presence.

17:56.920 --> 17:59.380
Imagine the statement they make
on display.

18:00.050 --> 18:02.250
Exactly because they're too imposing,

18:02.350 --> 18:04.280
I wouldn't even dare display them.

18:05.750 --> 18:07.610
It's right for others to think so,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.770
but you don't need to worry about that.

18:09.880 --> 18:10.640
Why?

18:12.550 --> 18:14.010
You're on the first floor.

18:14.720 --> 18:16.270
You can dig a basement.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.880
By then, forget the bianzhong set—

18:18.880 --> 18:20.320
even the Houmuwu Ding

18:20.510 --> 18:21.710
could fit down there.

18:22.550 --> 18:23.590
Dig a basement?

18:24.830 --> 18:25.790
Our company

18:26.160 --> 18:27.780
will do it for you—free.

18:27.960 --> 18:28.480
Well.

18:28.640 --> 18:30.370
I even brought the blueprints.

18:31.550 --> 18:32.610
Please take a look.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.320
Waterproof,

18:36.520 --> 18:37.230
shockproof,

18:36.650 --> 18:36.740
[Home Design Construction Drawings]

18:37.350 --> 18:38.800
[Drawing Index] [Project Overview]

18:37.400 --> 18:38.030
theft-proof,

18:38.030 --> 18:38.720
and nuclear blast-proof—

18:38.720 --> 18:40.580
you can rest completely assured.

18:45.640 --> 18:45.910
[Fang Zhong Zhuang Shi Gong Cheng You Xian Gong Si]
[Home Design Construction Drawings]

18:46.870 --> 18:48.270
That's too much trouble.

18:49.030 --> 18:50.830
I'll just take the Ru ware plate.

19:00.030 --> 19:00.800
Mr. Fang,

19:01.640 --> 19:02.830
do you know

19:02.850 --> 19:04.380
the story behind the plate?

19:04.680 --> 19:05.710
This plate

19:05.920 --> 19:08.240
was specially commissioned
by Emperor Qinzong of Song

19:08.240 --> 19:10.100
for his father, Emperor Huizong.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.510
And the very next day

19:11.510 --> 19:12.680
after father and son saw it—

19:12.680 --> 19:13.590
guess what?

19:14.110 --> 19:17.070
The Jin army stormed Kaifeng.

19:18.750 --> 19:19.410
After that,

19:19.720 --> 19:22.050
the three successive owners of this plate

19:22.510 --> 19:24.560
were killed one after another,

19:25.000 --> 19:27.160
as if cursed.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.920
Even those who tried to obtain it

19:30.000 --> 19:31.610
met bad ends.

19:32.470 --> 19:33.240
This time,

19:34.000 --> 19:35.920
after it was salvaged,

19:36.590 --> 19:37.960
the previous buyer

19:38.030 --> 19:39.960
had just made full payment—

19:40.070 --> 19:42.130
and before he even got to see it, he...

20:02.310 --> 20:03.960
Right now, we've got

20:04.160 --> 20:05.360
both of these things.

20:06.030 --> 20:07.090
Which one to choose

20:07.270 --> 20:08.110
is up to you.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.610
I've made up my mind.

20:15.830 --> 20:17.110
And your choice is?

20:19.070 --> 20:20.260
The Ru ware plate.

20:22.830 --> 20:23.760
Mr. Fang, you...

20:26.270 --> 20:27.160
Just kidding.

20:29.640 --> 20:30.770
I've made up my mind.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.120
I want the bianzhong set.

20:34.440 --> 20:35.200
Wise.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.270
Uncle!

20:42.790 --> 20:44.990
We can't hand it to each other directly.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.550
It's just bronze!

20:57.200 --> 20:58.330
How much do you want?

20:59.440 --> 21:00.460
2.5 million.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.370
Vulgar!

21:01.640 --> 21:02.510
Petty!

21:03.750 --> 21:04.680
I offer 800,000.

21:05.790 --> 21:06.400
800,000...

21:06.400 --> 21:07.550
Uncle Fei doing business with you

21:07.550 --> 21:09.150
is already doing you a favor.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.140
Don't push your luck.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.310
A-Alright.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.310
Then...

21:19.830 --> 21:21.230
when can we make the deal?

21:22.790 --> 21:23.650
We can do it now.

21:26.200 --> 21:27.260
Where's the money?

21:27.310 --> 21:27.880
What?

21:29.070 --> 21:31.330
Are you afraid Uncle Fei will rip you off?

21:35.240 --> 21:36.300
I have a condition.

21:37.350 --> 21:38.350
When this is sold,

21:38.830 --> 21:40.160
I'll give you the money.

21:42.270 --> 21:43.330
If you're worried,

21:43.720 --> 21:44.500
you can take

21:44.640 --> 21:46.100
this small one back first.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.400
When we sell it,

21:47.550 --> 21:48.350
you give it to me.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.080
Is that okay?

21:53.000 --> 21:54.360
To be honest,

21:54.640 --> 21:56.070
my buyer won't accept anything

21:56.070 --> 21:57.920
that isn't a complete set.

22:02.920 --> 22:03.860
A-Alright.

22:04.510 --> 22:05.760
Call the buyer.

22:06.270 --> 22:07.730
Within the next day or two,

22:08.200 --> 22:10.000
we'll go to Sanjiangkou together.

22:10.000 --> 22:10.440
Uncle,

22:10.750 --> 22:12.150
I won't be going with you.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.030
Why?

22:16.030 --> 22:17.030
To be honest,

22:18.000 --> 22:19.530
I'm in trouble with the law.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.510
With things this high-profile,

22:21.510 --> 22:22.370
I don't dare to.

22:22.400 --> 22:23.110
Well, then,

22:23.110 --> 22:24.770
how are you going to get there?

22:24.880 --> 22:25.960
The buyer is waiting.

22:25.960 --> 22:26.590
Besides,

22:26.590 --> 22:28.400
I am a very punctual person.

22:28.480 --> 22:29.000
Uncle,

22:30.070 --> 22:31.270
don't worry about me.

22:32.350 --> 22:33.810
I'll figure it out myself.

22:34.830 --> 22:36.160
See you in Sanjiangkou.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.680
It might be evidence.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.880
Most likely connected to Lu Zheng's death.

23:11.000 --> 23:11.720
This thing

23:11.750 --> 23:13.950
can never show up in Sanjiangkou again.

23:37.830 --> 23:39.230
It's still running fine.

23:55.790 --> 23:56.350
Zhou Qi!

24:06.880 --> 24:07.480
Officers,

24:07.510 --> 24:08.780
why are you here?

24:09.240 --> 24:11.440
That's quite an outfit you're wearing.

24:14.220 --> 24:15.150
Where did you go?

24:18.070 --> 24:18.830
I went out

24:19.030 --> 24:19.960
with my friends.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.240
The person who sold me these things

24:33.240 --> 24:34.300
is Zheng Yongbing.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.200
He deals in antiques

24:37.120 --> 24:38.720
and is a regular at our place.

24:39.160 --> 24:40.310
He once tipped a waitress

24:40.310 --> 24:42.240
with a gold necklace.

24:44.440 --> 24:45.830
She had it appraised,

24:46.200 --> 24:47.730
and it turned out to be real.

24:47.920 --> 24:48.720
He told us

24:48.750 --> 24:50.400
that he had a lot of jewelry

24:51.400 --> 24:53.130
and could sell it to us cheaply.

24:53.640 --> 24:55.110
He said even Mr. Zhou Rong

24:55.510 --> 24:56.850
bought things from him.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.400
So I believed him.

25:00.210 --> 25:01.870
I bought a necklace,

25:02.480 --> 25:03.350
a bracelet,

25:04.110 --> 25:05.630
two rings,

25:05.960 --> 25:07.690
and a pair of earrings from him.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.330
All for 20,000 yuan.

25:13.460 --> 25:14.230
On the night

25:15.070 --> 25:16.330
of Ye Jian's incident,

25:16.350 --> 25:17.680
were you at Fenglinwan?

25:17.790 --> 25:18.440
Yes.

25:18.660 --> 25:19.960
Between 11 p.m.

25:19.980 --> 25:21.380
and midnight that night,

25:21.480 --> 25:23.210
who can confirm you were there?

25:25.110 --> 25:27.110
Between 11 p.m. and midnight...

25:30.480 --> 25:32.080
Are you suspecting that I...

25:33.270 --> 25:34.010
Oh my God.

25:34.110 --> 25:35.200
I-I'm just a woman.

25:35.240 --> 25:36.160
How could I possibly kill someone?

25:36.160 --> 25:37.220
Who can confirm it?

25:37.790 --> 25:38.960
Everyone at Fenglinwan

25:38.960 --> 25:40.070
can confirm it.

25:40.720 --> 25:43.720
That night, I was at the bar downstairs
the whole time.

25:44.480 --> 25:45.110
We had

25:45.110 --> 25:47.070
an internet-famous DJ playing there.

25:47.070 --> 25:48.400
I was there all evening.

25:52.270 --> 25:52.790
Qi,

25:53.200 --> 25:53.880
so they only brought you in
for questioning

25:53.880 --> 25:54.960
because of the stolen goods

25:54.960 --> 25:55.790
you bought

25:56.350 --> 25:57.790
from Zheng Yongbing?

26:01.400 --> 26:03.460
I don't think that's the only reason.

26:04.240 --> 26:06.900
The police might just be
using that as an excuse.

26:09.480 --> 26:10.110
Oh, right,

26:10.750 --> 26:12.590
they also asked me about Ye Jian.

26:15.400 --> 26:17.860
What about that watch?
Did they ask about it?

26:18.350 --> 26:19.440
Yibo, don't worry.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.750
I got rid of that watch myself.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.830
By now it should be on a train,

26:23.830 --> 26:25.360
far away from Sanjiangkou.

26:27.270 --> 26:27.920
Qi.

26:29.440 --> 26:31.770
Everything that's been happening lately

26:32.030 --> 26:33.430
has been way too intense.

26:34.270 --> 26:35.530
Yeah, way too intense.

26:36.680 --> 26:38.640
When I went into the police station,

26:38.640 --> 26:39.550
I was so nervous

26:39.550 --> 26:40.680
I almost passed out.

26:41.550 --> 26:42.640
I thought the police were going

26:42.640 --> 26:43.900
to catch us right then.

26:46.690 --> 26:48.070
Feel my chest.

26:48.640 --> 26:50.460
My heart is still pounding.

26:52.270 --> 26:54.000
My heart is pounding too.

26:59.110 --> 26:59.720
Yibo...

27:01.830 --> 27:03.160
I'm feeling something.

27:06.430 --> 27:07.430
Seems like it.

27:15.510 --> 27:16.200
Yibo,

27:17.070 --> 27:18.530
you're getting worked up.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.740
Danger and excitement

27:22.200 --> 27:23.590
are your turn-ons.

27:25.680 --> 27:26.400
Then...

27:27.070 --> 27:28.870
say something else to excite me.

27:31.480 --> 27:32.110
Like what?

27:33.000 --> 27:33.830
Like what?

27:35.070 --> 27:36.550
Whatever's thrilling.

27:37.960 --> 27:40.160
The police are about to find that watch.

27:41.070 --> 27:41.830
What else?

27:42.750 --> 27:45.030
Mr. Rong won't let us off.

27:50.550 --> 27:52.810
Your game account's about to get hacked!

27:57.000 --> 27:58.330
At the explosion scene,

27:58.440 --> 28:00.590
Lu Yibo intercepted the report letter.

28:00.590 --> 28:01.460
Meanwhile,

28:01.640 --> 28:03.550
a jewelry store
in the provincial capital was robbed.

28:03.550 --> 28:04.640
The stolen goods

28:04.880 --> 28:06.400
were transferred to Sanjiangkou

28:06.400 --> 28:09.310
and ended up
in the hands of this man, Zheng Yongbing.

28:09.310 --> 28:11.030
Zheng Yongbing then sold them

28:11.070 --> 28:12.410
to Zhou Qi.

28:13.720 --> 28:16.400
Zhou Qi is Lu Yibo's girlfriend.

28:16.880 --> 28:17.610
How does this

28:17.640 --> 28:19.680
connect back to the provincial capital
explosion case again?

28:19.680 --> 28:20.510
I see it now.

28:20.680 --> 28:22.110
They're a gang, right?

28:22.880 --> 28:24.070
Zheng Yongbing is in charge of
fencing the stolen goods.

28:24.070 --> 28:25.200
You see what? What do you see?

28:25.200 --> 28:26.240
How could Zheng Yongbing

28:26.240 --> 28:28.170
possibly be connected to the case?

28:36.440 --> 28:37.110
Chief Zhang,

28:37.110 --> 28:37.690
I think

28:37.720 --> 28:38.780
he has nothing to do

28:38.790 --> 28:39.850
with our case here.

28:41.230 --> 28:41.820
Oh!

28:44.070 --> 28:45.100
Didn't he say

28:45.310 --> 28:47.910
that even Zhou Rong
bought things from him too?

28:47.960 --> 28:49.690
I think we should look into him.

28:51.950 --> 28:54.610
It's necessary to
investigate Zheng Yongbing.

28:54.640 --> 28:55.370
Chief Zhang,

28:55.480 --> 28:56.000
I think,

28:56.020 --> 28:57.270
since it's related to
a provincial capital case,

28:57.270 --> 28:58.220
we should report it up

28:58.220 --> 28:59.480
and let them handle it.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.350
If this case is going to be investigated,

29:01.350 --> 29:03.440
we'll have to handle it ourselves.

29:03.960 --> 29:04.690
Chief Zhang,

29:04.780 --> 29:05.960
I know you're capable.

29:05.960 --> 29:07.070
You can solve any case;

29:07.070 --> 29:08.000
it's just a matter of time,

29:08.000 --> 29:08.480
right?

29:08.680 --> 29:10.880
But we have to prioritize.

29:11.070 --> 29:11.830
Ye's case,

29:12.000 --> 29:12.830
my mentor's case—

29:12.830 --> 29:13.830
we don't even have leads yet.

29:13.830 --> 29:14.400
And there're tons of customers

29:14.400 --> 29:15.590
at Fenglinwan worth investigating.

29:15.590 --> 29:16.830
Can we really go through them one by one?

29:16.830 --> 29:17.640
If necessary,

29:18.720 --> 29:20.030
then yes—

29:20.490 --> 29:22.350
we have to investigate them one by one.

29:22.350 --> 29:23.510
I agree.

29:24.790 --> 29:25.790
And we need to look into

29:25.790 --> 29:27.030
that internet-famous DJ too,

29:27.030 --> 29:29.360
to verify
if Zhou Qi was telling the truth.

29:30.310 --> 29:30.880
I agree.

29:31.350 --> 29:31.790
Okay.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.330
If everyone agrees,

29:34.510 --> 29:35.370
we'll start...

29:36.200 --> 29:38.000
Captain Wang, what do you think?

29:38.550 --> 29:39.960
I think...

29:42.590 --> 29:43.160
I agree.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.200
Good.

29:44.630 --> 29:45.960
Since everyone agrees,

29:46.440 --> 29:48.440
we'll investigate Zheng Yongbing.

30:01.960 --> 30:02.480
Zheng,

30:02.840 --> 30:03.470
have you eaten?

30:03.470 --> 30:05.200
Just heading out for lunch now.

30:29.640 --> 30:30.600
Zheng Yongbing,

30:30.820 --> 30:31.810
46 years old.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.680
At 17, he was sentenced to three years

30:33.680 --> 30:34.480
for theft.

30:34.750 --> 30:35.700
At 23,

30:36.000 --> 30:38.240
sentenced to five years for tomb raiding.

30:38.240 --> 30:38.960
After release,

30:38.960 --> 30:40.510
no further offenses on record.

30:40.510 --> 30:42.300
He now runs an antique shop.

30:43.270 --> 30:43.830
Zheng!

30:46.070 --> 30:47.020
Eat up, eat up.

30:47.040 --> 30:47.900
I'll go line up.

30:49.160 --> 30:49.880
Family-wise,

30:49.880 --> 30:51.480
he divorced his wife years ago.

30:51.480 --> 30:52.960
Their child lives with her.

30:52.960 --> 30:55.000
Captain Wang learned from some insiders

30:55.000 --> 30:55.960
that, besides

30:55.960 --> 30:57.440
his antique shop business,

30:57.440 --> 30:58.500
he also secretly deals in stolen goods

30:58.500 --> 30:59.720
and resells cultural relics.

30:59.720 --> 31:00.320
But so far,

31:00.400 --> 31:02.800
these have all been small-scale dealings.

31:03.280 --> 31:05.000
There might be something bigger

31:05.000 --> 31:07.060
hiding behind those small dealings.

31:25.580 --> 31:28.640
[Antique and Modern Collectibles;
Jade and Precious Stones]

31:31.920 --> 31:33.250
Can we see him from here?

31:40.170 --> 31:42.660
[Antique and Modern Collectibles;
Jade and Precious Stones]

31:42.730 --> 31:44.260
What's he eating for lunch?

31:51.150 --> 31:52.480
You've even got the equipment?

31:52.480 --> 31:53.510
Good. Not bad.

31:56.960 --> 31:58.560
He's eating pretty lightly.

31:58.640 --> 31:59.440
Cornbread,

31:59.590 --> 32:00.720
boiled vegetables.

32:01.000 --> 32:02.030
He has fatty liver disease.

32:02.030 --> 32:03.960
His doctor told him to lose weight.

32:04.920 --> 32:05.790
Then that diet's on point.

32:05.790 --> 32:07.850
Cornbread is made from whole grains.

32:08.510 --> 32:09.840
He's quite enjoying it.

32:12.200 --> 32:12.750
Chief,

32:13.270 --> 32:14.130
are you hungry?

32:15.750 --> 32:16.510
I'm fine.

32:19.270 --> 32:21.270
I brought two buns from the canteen.

32:22.550 --> 32:24.010
Pickled cabbage filling.

32:25.270 --> 32:27.130
Buns... Y-You even brought buns?

32:27.350 --> 32:28.750
Is your bag a magic bag or something?

32:28.750 --> 32:29.550
I'll have one.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.290
Some people live to eat.

32:39.000 --> 32:40.030
And I eat to live.

32:47.160 --> 32:49.020
Go ahead, say what you want to say.

32:50.590 --> 32:52.680
I feel like you've been very confident

32:52.680 --> 32:53.810
these past few days.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.000
Yeah?

32:57.030 --> 32:57.510
What's that supposed to mean?

32:57.510 --> 32:59.040
I wasn't confident before?

32:59.110 --> 33:00.440
That's not what I meant.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.510
It's true. I...

33:06.030 --> 33:06.720
Over the years,

33:06.720 --> 33:08.790
I haven't liked to
get involved in these things much.

33:08.790 --> 33:09.640
Mainly because

33:09.640 --> 33:10.590
for a long stretch,

33:10.590 --> 33:12.480
I was just... jinxed.

33:13.350 --> 33:14.850
Whenever I got involved,

33:15.310 --> 33:16.200
not only could I not help,

33:16.200 --> 33:18.530
but I'd end up causing trouble for others.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.170
But

33:19.200 --> 33:19.920
I found that

33:20.070 --> 33:21.640
since I came to Sanjiangkou,

33:21.640 --> 33:23.030
something's different.

33:23.030 --> 33:24.360
Something has changed.

33:24.400 --> 33:25.130
It's like...

33:27.030 --> 33:28.000
my bad luck has turned to good fortune,

33:28.000 --> 33:30.000
and every disaster into a blessing.

33:34.200 --> 33:35.000
I've decided.

33:35.720 --> 33:36.480
From now on,

33:37.480 --> 33:38.610
I'm going to change.

33:38.920 --> 33:39.830
I have to...

33:40.440 --> 33:41.240
I have to...

33:41.440 --> 33:43.040
Show off your skills, Chief.

33:47.110 --> 33:48.440
Can I ask you something?

33:49.160 --> 33:50.030
Chief, please go ahead.

33:50.030 --> 33:50.720
Just that.

33:51.240 --> 33:52.200
When it's

33:52.310 --> 33:53.320
just the two of us

33:53.350 --> 33:54.330
in the future,

33:54.480 --> 33:56.540
stop calling me "Chief" all the time.

33:56.920 --> 33:57.980
Just call me Zhang.

34:02.030 --> 34:03.550
Okay. Zhang.

34:23.210 --> 34:27.199
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

34:35.320 --> 34:36.230
I already spoke on the phone

34:36.230 --> 34:36.960
with that out-of-town

34:36.960 --> 34:38.159
internet-famous DJ.

34:38.400 --> 34:39.510
They said that night,

34:39.510 --> 34:40.679
Zhou Qi really was around

34:40.679 --> 34:41.840
the DJ booth at Fenglinwan the whole time,

34:41.840 --> 34:42.969
looking after them.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.500
So we're just supposed to

34:44.500 --> 34:45.360
take his word for it?

34:45.360 --> 34:47.090
Besides, he's not even in town.

34:56.630 --> 34:57.430
What's wrong?

34:58.760 --> 35:00.670
Since he's an internet-famous DJ

35:00.670 --> 35:02.110
performing at Fenglinwan,

35:02.110 --> 35:04.370
there should be some buzz online, right?

35:12.430 --> 35:20.260
[Chuanshi Antique Collections]

35:13.800 --> 35:15.660
Next time, don't just bring buns.

35:16.360 --> 35:17.490
Bring some vinegar,

35:17.670 --> 35:18.360
garlic,

35:19.280 --> 35:19.960
and chili.

35:20.920 --> 35:21.960
We can't just swallow them dry either.

35:21.960 --> 35:23.580
Better to have something to drink, right?

35:23.580 --> 35:25.400
Some porridge would be even better.

35:25.400 --> 35:29.940
♪ Throw a toy to
that bunch of brokers in town ♪

35:27.360 --> 35:27.920
Zheng!

35:28.030 --> 35:28.670
Hey, man!

35:28.670 --> 35:29.800
How are you? Have you eaten?

35:29.800 --> 35:30.890
Not yet. Going back to eat.

35:30.890 --> 35:31.950
-See you.
-See you.

35:33.890 --> 35:37.730
♪ From doubt, I forge a weapon ♪

35:35.710 --> 35:36.320
Zhang.

35:36.920 --> 35:37.880
Zheng Yongbing really

35:37.880 --> 35:39.680
doesn't look suspicious at all.

35:40.760 --> 35:41.320
That's

35:41.270 --> 35:42.650
♪ Oh, god ♪

35:41.320 --> 35:42.360
exactly the point.

35:42.360 --> 35:43.480
The fact that he looks so unsuspicious

35:43.480 --> 35:44.670
is precisely what makes him suspicious.

35:44.280 --> 35:46.900
♪ Please give me some guidance ♪

35:48.360 --> 35:50.160
He used to fight a lot when he was young

35:48.370 --> 35:50.950
♪ Find the sleepy poet ♪

35:50.400 --> 35:51.440
and did some time.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.120
Now he's got a bit of money.

35:52.800 --> 35:54.260
♪ They are all guests ♪

35:55.190 --> 35:55.850
Look at him.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.110
Don't you think he's being a bit

35:57.110 --> 35:58.150
too low-key?

35:58.970 --> 36:01.510
♪ There's a strange, hazy feeling ♪

35:59.480 --> 36:00.690
What is he hiding

36:00.760 --> 36:02.820
that he's so afraid of being noticed?

36:03.050 --> 36:04.400
♪ Waiting for me to make sense of it ♪

36:05.080 --> 36:07.330
♪ Worshippers hiding in the smoke,
just beyond reach ♪

36:08.580 --> 36:10.840
What's he doing
wandering around like that?

36:09.510 --> 36:10.920
♪ They are all guests ♪

36:14.130 --> 36:15.620
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

36:22.360 --> 36:23.840
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

36:27.070 --> 36:28.340
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

36:28.510 --> 36:29.230
Look.

36:30.280 --> 36:32.540
He's definitely got something going on.

36:41.280 --> 36:41.760
Sir!

36:41.800 --> 36:42.280
What's wrong?

36:42.280 --> 36:43.360
Don't park at the entrance!

36:43.360 --> 36:44.250
Move it up.

36:44.280 --> 36:45.810
I can park on the side, yeah?

37:03.800 --> 37:04.480
Zhang!

37:04.690 --> 37:05.690
Stop right there!

37:05.800 --> 37:06.730
W-What's wrong?

37:07.230 --> 37:08.430
Let me see your phone.

37:08.510 --> 37:09.480
Why do you want to see my phone?

37:09.480 --> 37:10.590
Who were you calling behind my back?

37:10.590 --> 37:11.440
I didn't call anyone!

37:11.440 --> 37:12.670
-I wasn't doing anything...
-Give it to me!

37:12.670 --> 37:13.480
Look, I just...

37:13.480 --> 37:14.630
I just called my colleague Tian.

37:14.630 --> 37:14.960
You...

37:14.960 --> 37:16.290
Right, your colleague!

37:20.670 --> 37:21.270
He's gone.

37:22.030 --> 37:24.160
He must've just come out to buy dinner.

37:25.320 --> 37:25.800
Look.

37:26.190 --> 37:26.720
Let's go.

37:28.110 --> 37:28.630
Zhang.

37:45.440 --> 37:46.840
You're munching away quite happily there.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.240
Are you looking closely?

37:48.710 --> 37:49.800
My mouth may not have stopped,

37:49.800 --> 37:51.660
but my eyes never left the screen.

37:53.440 --> 37:55.300
Captain Wang, have some nuts too.

37:59.920 --> 38:01.380
Thousands of photos here.

38:01.840 --> 38:04.370
When are we ever going to
get through them all?

38:05.400 --> 38:05.840
Seriously.

38:05.840 --> 38:07.030
You've checked my phone
three times this week.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.030
Can't you trust me a little?

38:08.030 --> 38:09.280
Do you really think
I'd do something like that to you?

38:09.280 --> 38:09.680
You...

38:09.880 --> 38:10.800
You haven't?

38:11.320 --> 38:12.420
Well, let me see.

38:12.480 --> 38:13.150
Go ahead.

38:13.150 --> 38:14.000
It's all work stuff!

38:14.000 --> 38:14.860
What could I...

38:15.150 --> 38:16.300
I'd like to see

38:17.030 --> 38:18.630
what kind of work business
you've got going on.

38:18.630 --> 38:19.340
Check then.

38:19.440 --> 38:21.640
You're not gonna find anything anyway.

38:22.670 --> 38:23.670
What did you find?

38:26.710 --> 38:27.570
He went inside.

38:29.550 --> 38:32.150
Acting all jumpy—
he's definitely hiding something.

38:32.150 --> 38:32.750
Should we

38:32.880 --> 38:33.760
follow him in?

38:34.190 --> 38:34.670
Okay.

38:38.800 --> 38:39.510
A call.

38:41.920 --> 38:43.190
Chief Zhang, a major discovery.

38:43.190 --> 38:44.150
Ye was at Fenglinwan

38:44.150 --> 38:45.000
that night.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.280
See?

38:47.840 --> 38:49.240
Okay, I'll be right back.

38:49.960 --> 38:50.960
Should I go back with you?

38:50.960 --> 38:51.840
No, no.

38:51.930 --> 38:53.550
You stay here and keep watching.

38:53.550 --> 38:54.630
Something's off about that guy.

38:54.630 --> 38:56.070
Something's definitely going on.

38:56.070 --> 38:57.730
I'll let Song Xing replace me.

38:58.720 --> 38:59.910
[Loyalty]

39:00.500 --> 39:01.390
[Loyalty]

39:05.480 --> 39:06.070
Which one is he?

39:06.070 --> 39:06.600
This one.

39:09.670 --> 39:10.730
This is Captain Ye?

39:10.840 --> 39:11.300
That...

39:11.550 --> 39:12.810
That's definitely Ye.

39:13.150 --> 39:14.400
That hairstyle, that build—

39:14.400 --> 39:16.860
it's like he's standing
right in front of me.

39:18.630 --> 39:19.590
If we just take this blurry photo

39:19.590 --> 39:21.000
of the back of his head

39:21.070 --> 39:21.920
to Fenglinwan,

39:21.920 --> 39:22.880
it won't be appropriate, right?

39:22.880 --> 39:24.480
We just brought Zhou Qi in

39:24.630 --> 39:26.480
to assist with the investigation.

39:26.480 --> 39:28.340
Lu Yibo is on high alert right now.

39:28.470 --> 39:29.480
He would just deny everything.

39:29.480 --> 39:30.880
This photo won't help us.

39:32.230 --> 39:33.700
So you're saying
the lead isn't strong enough?

39:33.700 --> 39:35.830
This doesn't even count as a real lead.

39:36.110 --> 39:37.150
Are there

39:37.190 --> 39:37.800
any clearer photos?

39:37.800 --> 39:38.860
I'll keep looking.

39:49.230 --> 39:50.710
Should we bring in some more manpower?
